WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A small piece of a company. A stock represents ownership. One share is one unit of that ownership.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Cash becomes shares. Buy 2 shares at $100 each: spend $200 in cash and own 2 shares.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Value can rise. If each share reaches $110, 2 shares are worth $220. That is a $20 unrealized gain.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Value can fall. If each share falls to $90, 2 shares are worth $180. That is a $20 unrealized loss.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Practice the idea. Use virtual cash in Sprout. A real stock never guarantees a profit.

